on, pandas now has ```select_dtypes```:\n```df.select_dtypes(include=[np.number])\nOut:\n   A    B   C\n0  1  1.0  1j\n1  2  2.0  2j\n2  3  3.0  3j\n```"], "originalsource": "stackexchange", "originalprompt": "Is there a better way to determine whether a variable in ```Pandas``` and/or ```NumPy``` is ```numeric``` or not ? \nI have a self defined ```dictionary``` with ```dtypes``` as keys and ```numeric``` / ```not``` as values."}
